</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5. </span><math id="S6.F5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{\textup{acc}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>acc</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{\textup{acc}}</annotation></semantics></math> &amp; <math id="S6.F5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{\textup{ppl}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>ppl</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{\textup{ppl}}</annotation></semantics></math> of models with <math id="S6.F5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>=11. Results are averaged over 3 runs with different random seeds on MMLU.</figcaption>
</figure>
