<div id="A1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Contributions of <math id="A1.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{\textup{acc}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">acc</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{\textup{acc}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{\textup{ppl}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">ppl</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{\textup{ppl}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>
Similar results and findings can be obtained by aligning Figure <a href="#A1.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ Appendix A Appendix: Results of SASER with robust model ‣ SASER: Stego attacks on open-source LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> &amp; <a href="#S6.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ 6.2. Results and Evaluation ‣ 6. Experiments and Evaluation ‣ SASER: Stego attacks on open-source LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, and Figure <a href="#A1.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ Appendix A Appendix: Results of SASER with robust model ‣ SASER: Stego attacks on open-source LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> &amp; <a href="#S6.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ 6.2. Results and Evaluation ‣ 6. Experiments and Evaluation ‣ SASER: Stego attacks on open-source LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
